## SPRINT METADATA

Sprint name:     basket_to_checkout_handshake
Chunk scope:     From user clicking "Checkout" on basket page to successful
                 window.location.assign(stripeUrl) executing — and all failure
                 paths that branch from that corridor.
Spec authority:  pre-checkout-state-machine-spec v2.0 §1–§10
Global pipeline: This chunk is Phase 1 of the checkout pipeline.
                 Neighbour upstream:   basket page (product/quantity management)
                 Neighbour downstream: Stripe hosted checkout → success/cancel URL landing

Scope lock rules (MANDATORY — violations block sprint lock):
  - NO changes to globals.css
  - NO changes to homepage components
  - NO changes to basket item data structures (shape is fixed input)
  - NO changes to Sanity schema or GROQ queries
  - NO changes to Inngest job definitions (lock expiry is out-of-band, read-only here)
  - NO improvements outside scope contracts below
  - ALL new files go under app/components/features/basket/checkout/ or
    app/actions/checkout/ or store/preCheckout/ unless a contract explicitly
    states otherwise
  - ZERO server-side redirect() calls. All navigation via window.location.assign()

