### Step 2: End-State Spatial Map

Desktop (1280px) — Basket page, IDLE state:
  [HEADER — full width]
  [BASKET PAGE — max-w-content, mx-auto, px-8]
    [BASKET ITEM LIST — left col, ~60% width]
    [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL — right col, ~40% width]
      [CHECKOUT BUTTON — full width of panel, enabled]

Desktop (1280px) — PROCESSING state:
  [SAME LAYOUT]
    [BASKET ITEM LIST — all controls disabled, opacity-50 or similar lock]
    [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL]
      [CHECKOUT BUTTON — disabled, spinner visible, "Processing..." text]

Desktop (1280px) — ERROR_NETWORK state:
  [SAME LAYOUT]
    [BASKET ITEM LIST — all controls STILL disabled]
    [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL]
      [ERROR BANNER — "Connection failed", full-width of panel]
      [RETRY BUTTON — sole CTA, full-width of panel]

Desktop (1280px) — ERROR_VALIDATION state:
  [SAME LAYOUT]
    [BASKET ITEM LIST — all controls STILL disabled (user must use Update basket)]
    [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL]
      [VALIDATION BANNER — "Your basket has been updated" + per-item diff list]
      [ACCEPT & CONTINUE BUTTON — disabled until basket mutations complete]
      [UPDATE BASKET BUTTON — secondary CTA, fires RESET → IDLE]

Desktop (1280px) — SUCCESS state:
  [SAME LAYOUT — all controls disabled]
    [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL]
      ["Redirecting to payment..." message — no buttons]

Mobile (375px) — all states:
  [HEADER]
  [BASKET ITEMS — full width, stacked]
  [ORDER SUMMARY PANEL — full width, below items]
    [Same state-driven content as desktop panel, full width]

