## PHASE 5: EXECUTION ORDER

Execute scope contracts in this exact sequence. Do not begin a contract until
the previous contract's /test gate passes.

  1. SC1 — Machine core (no dependencies)
  2. SC2 — Server action (depends on SC1 types)
  3. SC3 — AbortController hook (depends on SC1 types, SC2 function)
  4. SC4 — SUCCESS handler + lock release (depends on SC1 types, SC2 action)
  5. SC5 — Accept & Continue guard (depends on SC1 types, SC3 hook)
  6. SC6 — Orchestrator hook (depends on SC1–SC5 all)
  7. SC7 — Cancel URL handler (depends on SC6 hook)
  8. SC8 — UI rendering (depends on SC6 hook, SC7 handler)

